<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/ComposedForm> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Une forme composée : une phrase, une proposition, un énoncé, un paragraphe, une section ou un texte représenté comme un arbre de positions indexées. Elle déclare son niveau par lang:compositionLevel, ses constituants par lang:formSlot et sa tête, lorsque la structure de tête est analysée, par lang:formHead. L’ordre des constituants est porté par des individus lang:FormSlot munis d’un lang:slotIndex entier, jamais par l’ordre d’une liste RDF — deux encodages d’une même forme doivent désigner une seule forme. L’alternance codique est compositionnelle : la forme composée appartient à son système matrice, tandis que les constituants enchâssés portent le leur." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/ComposedForm> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "组合形式" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/ComposedForm> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/ComposedForm/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一种组合形式：将短语、分句、句子、段落、章节或文本表示为由索引槽位构成的树。它通过 lang:compositionLevel 声明层级，通过 lang:formSlot 声明组成成分，并在分析中心语结构时通过 lang:formHead 声明中心语。成分顺序由带整数 lang:slotIndex 的 lang:FormSlot 个体承载，绝不依赖 RDF 列表次序——同一形式的两种编码必须仍是同一形式。语码转换具有组合性：组合形式属于其主体系统，嵌入成分则各自携带所属系统。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-11/cell/CompositionRule/external/0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
