<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SignSystem/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "符号系统" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SignSystem/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
