<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/SurfaceAnchor> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Une ancre externe qui localise une forme de surface dans une source : elle nomme la source par lang:anchorSource, l’étendue par lang:anchorStart et lang:anchorEnd, et l’espace de décalage par lang:offsetSpace (octet, point de code ou grappe de graphèmes). Le matériau de la strate surfacique est exclu de l’identité de la forme mais inclus dans l’identité de surface ; l’ancre fait de la discipline de hachage de la prose une recherche plutôt qu’un recalcul." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/SurfaceAnchor> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "表层锚点" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/SurfaceAnchor> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceAnchor/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一种外置锚点，用于在来源中定位表层形式：通过 lang:anchorSource 命名来源，通过 lang:anchorStart 和 lang:anchorEnd 命名跨度，并通过 lang:offsetSpace 命名偏移空间（字节、码点或字素簇）。表层材料不计入抽象形式的同一性，但计入表层同一性；正是该锚点使散文哈希规范成为查找，而非重新计算。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/external/0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
