<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/SurfaceForm> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Une réalisation concrète d’une forme : un texte (par lang:surfaceText) doté d’une écriture déclarée (lang:inScript), d’un encodage (lang:encoding), d’une normalisation Unicode (lang:unicodeNormalization) et d’une locale de collation (lang:collationLocale). C’est la seule strate où l’identité des octets a un sens : deux formes de surface normalisées différemment sont des formes de surface distinctes d’une forme possiblement identique. Une surface réalise soit une forme analysée par lang:realizes, soit elle est typée lang:UnanalyzedProse — jamais l’un ou l’autre implicitement — et déclare son degré d’analyse par lang:analysisLevel. Elle peut porter une lang:SurfaceAnchor qui la localise dans un document source. Réencoder ou renormaliser un texte crée de nouvelles formes de surface, mais aucune nouvelle forme." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/SurfaceForm> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "表层形式" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/SurfaceForm> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/SurfaceForm/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "形式的一种具体实现：文本（通过 lang:surfaceText）连同已声明的文字（lang:inScript）、编码（lang:encoding）、Unicode 规范化方式（lang:unicodeNormalization）和排序区域（lang:collationLocale）。这是字节同一性有意义的唯一层次：规范化方式不同的两个表层形式可能实现同一个抽象形式，但仍是不同的表层形式。表层形式要么通过 lang:realizes 实现已分析形式，要么被标注为 lang:UnanalyzedProse——绝不含糊省略——并通过 lang:analysisLevel 声明分析程度。它可以携带 lang:SurfaceAnchor，以便在来源文档中定位。重新编码或重新规范化文本会产生新的表层形式，但不会产生新的抽象形式。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/TranslationUnit/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/TranslationUnit/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/TranslationUnit/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/TranslationUnit/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/TranslationUnit> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lang/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/TranslationUnit/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Unité de traduction" .
