<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/Rule/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/Rule/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/Rule/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Rule> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/Rule/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一种能产生结论的 Horn 或分层否定推导：当每个正向 logic:body 原子成立、每个 logic:negatedBody 原子在其声明的闭包中均不存在且所有守卫都成功时，其 logic:head 被蕴涵。它既不是一般的 logic:Formula，也不是完整性 logic:Constraint；规则片段之外的构造仍保留为公式树，并作为投影残留携带，而不会被近似替代。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/Rule/zh/skos-example> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
