<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/Rule/zh/skos-example> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Rule> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/Rule/zh/skos-example> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一条规则可以由 ex:parent(x,y) 与 ex:ancestor(y,z) 推导 ex:ancestor(x,z)，其中变量在规则体中被正向绑定。" .
