<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic/authoring-packet/whole/batch-3/cell/ConstraintSugar/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一种创作描述符，逻辑前端会将其展开为一个带有具象化完整性公式的规范 logic:Constraint。约束语法糖记录为封闭验证模式及其参数命名；它本身不是 logic:Formula 抽象语法树节点，因此公式构造器检查不会把验证元数据误当作对象层语句。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic/authoring-packet/whole/batch-3/cell/ConstraintSugar/zh/skos-example> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
