<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/AlternativeHypothesis> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Une hypothèse alternative (H1) : le complément de l'hypothèse nulle vers lequel un math:HypothesisTest pèse les preuves — l'affirmation d'un effet présent dont la direction fixe la math:alternativeSidedness du test. Une sous-classe de math:Hypothesis, nommée par un test via math:alternativeHypothesis ; sa directionnalité (unilatérale, bilatérale, …) est portée sur la valeur p en tant que latéralité, et non laissée implicite." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/AlternativeHypothesis> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "备择假设" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/AlternativeHypothesis> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AlternativeHypothesis/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个备择假设（H1）：math:HypothesisTest 将证据权衡指向的、与零假设互补的一方——断言效应存在，其方向确定了检验的 math:alternativeSidedness。它是 math:Hypothesis 的子类，由检验通过 math:alternativeHypothesis 命名；其方向性（单侧、双侧、……）作为侧向性承载于 p 值之上，而非留作隐含。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
