<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/AnalysisPlan> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Plan d'analyse" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/AnalysisPlan> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Un plan d'analyse : le plan préspécifié qu'un résultat prétend suivre — les critères de jugement primaires et secondaires, l'estimande, le modèle et la règle de décision fixés AVANT que les données ne soient vues. Une sous-classe de math:MathematicalObject portant sa version via math:analysisPlanVersion (un littéral de version ou un objet version) et nommée par l'exécution d'inférence qui l'a appliqué via math:usedAnalysisPlan, de sorte que le pré-enregistré face au post-hoc est une donnée, non un contexte perdu. Un résultat qui nomme le plan et la version qu'il a suivie est un résultat dont l'affirmation « l'analyse a été préspécifiée » est auditable plutôt qu'asserée." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/AnalysisPlan> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "分析计划" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/AnalysisPlan> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalysisPlan/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个分析计划：结果声称遵循的、事先设定的计划——在看到数据之前就固定下来的主要与次要终点、估计目标、模型以及决策规则。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类，通过 math:analysisPlanVersion（一个版本字面量或一个版本对象）承载其版本，并由运行该计划的推断运行通过 math:usedAnalysisPlan 命名，因而预注册与事后分析之别是数据，而非丢失的上下文。命名了所遵循的计划及其版本的结果，其“分析事先设定”的主张可审计，而非仅凭断言。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AnalyticProperty/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
