<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-1/cell/BoundaryAtInfinity/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "无穷远边界" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-1/cell/BoundaryAtInfinity/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
