<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-1/cell/BoundaryAtInfinity/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-1/cell/BoundaryAtInfinity/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/BoundaryAtInfinity> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-1/cell/BoundaryAtInfinity/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个紧化在无穷远处所添加的边界：理想点——共形边界——原无界空间趋近却永不到达者，被作为头等对象而非非正式的边缘。由一个 math:Compactification 通过 math:boundaryAtInfinity 命名。对一个 math:ConformalCompactification 而言，它是 math:conformalFactor 消失之处；对径向半直线 r ∈ [0, ∞) 而言，它是唯一的理想点 r = +∞。" .
