<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-1/cell/CalibrationSenseConflation/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/CalibrationSenseConflation> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-1/cell/CalibrationSenseConflation/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "当一个节点同时被标注为 math:CalibrationDiagnostic 与 math:StabilityCalibrationRecord 时所引发的失败——校准的统计含义（模型预测概率对照观测频率）与拓扑含义（一个信念度对照 math:PersistenceLifetime 上的瓶颈稳定性界来校准）相混淆。它们只共享“校准”一词而别无其他。由于 math:CalibrationDiagnostic ⊑ math:ModelDiagnostic ⊑ math:MathematicalObject 且 math:StabilityCalibrationRecord ⊑ math:MathematicalObject，二者都自 math:MathematicalObject 派生，因此不相交并非由父类蕴含，而是直接断言（math:CalibrationDiagnostic owl:disjointWith math:StabilityCalibrationRecord）；原生描述逻辑一致性关卡会将任何同时被标注为二者的个体强制归入 owl:Nothing，配对的 SHACL 形状（math:CalibrationSenseConflationShape）则将同一混淆作为发现暴露出来，使使用方按具体类别选择，绝不按共享的记号选择。" .
