<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-1/cell/ClosedFormFunction/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-1/cell/ClosedFormFunction/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ClosedFormFunction> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-1/cell/ClosedFormFunction/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "闭形式函数" .
