<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Une hypothèse nulle (H0) : la valeur par défaut testée qu'un math:HypothesisTest présume et sous laquelle une valeur p est calculée — l'affirmation d'absence d'effet ou d'absence de différence dont le comportement d'échantillonnage cadre la statistique de test. Une sous-classe de math:Hypothesis, nommée par un test via math:nullHypothesis et par une math:PValue comme l'hypothèse sur laquelle son P(T ≥ t | H0) est conditionné." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/NullHypothesis> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "零假设" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/NullHypothesis> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-10/cell/NullHypothesis/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个零假设（H0）：一个 math:HypothesisTest 所预设、p 值在其下被计算的被检验默认——无效应或无差异的主张，其抽样行为为检验统计量框定框架。它是 math:Hypothesis 的子类，由一个检验通过 math:nullHypothesis 命名，也由一个 math:PValue 命名为其 P(T ≥ t | H0) 所条件化的假设。" .
