<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-13/cell/SamplingWeight/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Poids de sondage" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-13/cell/SamplingWeight/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
