<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-13/cell/SamplingWeight/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/SamplingWeight> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-13/cell/SamplingWeight/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个抽样权重：附于一个观测单元的设计权重——在 math:SurveyDesign 下它所代表的总体单元数，即其选择概率之倒数，经无应答与校准调整。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类，将权重命名为头等对象，使一个加权估计可被作为多于一个简单均值来分析。权重是设计的一部分，绝非它所缩放的被测值之内在属性。" .
