<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-14/cell/StatisticalPower/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-14/cell/StatisticalPower/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/StatisticalPower> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-14/cell/StatisticalPower/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "统计功效：1 − β，当一个指定备择成立时一个检验正确拒绝零假设的概率——回答“这个检验有多大可能检出它所设计针对的效应”的运行特征。它是 math:FrequentistResult 的子类；一个在备择下对照检验之抽样行为而定义的频率派量，是其 math:TypeIIErrorRate 之补。" .
