<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-15/cell/UnbackedAnalyticProperty/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "当一个 math:AnalyticProperty 不解析为任何定义律时引发的失败——它既不携带指向真实一阶 logic:Formula（math:nonAffinityLaw、math:convexityLaw、math:boundednessLaw）的 math:definingLaw 弧，也不携带指向诚实 logic:expressivenessBoundary 边界记录（math:smoothnessBoundary）的弧。单调性或解析性质主张必须由真实定律或已记录边界支撑，绝非裸标志；裸解析性质标记在构造上不可编写。由受护存在性 logic:Constraint math:AnalyticPropertyBackedConstraint（每个 math:AnalyticProperty 都要求一个 math:definingLaw）强制执行，降级为 SHACL sh:sparql 约束。" .
