<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-16/cell/UnderspecifiedCompactification/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-16/cell/UnderspecifiedCompactification/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/UnderspecifiedCompactification> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-16/cell/UnderspecifiedCompactification/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "当一个 math:Compactification 未命名其四个角色的全部——其原空间（math:originalSpace）、其紧化映射（math:compactifyingMap）、其紧化空间（math:compactifiedSpace）与其无穷远边界（math:boundaryAtInfinity）——或当一个 math:ConformalCompactification 额外遗漏其 math:conformalFactor 时所引发的失败。一个不说明它嵌入什么、由何映射、嵌入何处、以及以何无穷远边界的紧化是病态的。它对应 math:UnderspecifiedManifold 与 math:UnderspecifiedChart。" .
