<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/UnitPolicy/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "单位策略" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/UnitPolicy/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/UnitPolicy/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/UnitPolicy/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/UnitPolicy/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/UnitPolicy> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/UnitPolicy/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个单位策略：一个 math:StatisticalVariable 之值如何被赋予量纲与编码——所记录数字所遵循的测量单位、舍入与编码约定。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类，命名该约定，使一个值绝非缺少赋予其意义之策略的裸数。它与缺失值编码不同，后者由 math:MissingValueCode 承载；单位策略治理存在的值，而非其缺失。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
