<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Rôle de variable" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/VariableRole> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Un rôle de variable : la part analytique qu'une math:StatisticalVariable joue dans un modèle — issue, prédicteur, covariable, poids, strate, grappe ou décalage. Une sous-classe de math:MathematicalObject nommant le rôle qu'une variable tient plutôt qu'une propriété intrinsèque de la colonne, de sorte que la même variable mesurée puisse être une issue dans un modèle et un prédicteur dans un autre sans changer les données. Le rôle d'une variable est un objet de première classe afin que la structure d'un modèle soit interrogeable, jamais lue sur une convention de nommage." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/VariableRole> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "变量角色" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/VariableRole> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/VariableRole/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个变量角色：一个 math:StatisticalVariable 在一个模型中所扮演的分析性部分——结局、预测因子、协变量、权重、层、整群或偏置。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类，命名一个变量所持的角色而非该列的一个内在属性，因而同一个被测变量在一个模型中可为结局、在另一个模型中可为预测因子而不改变数据。一个变量的角色是一个头等对象，使一个模型的结构可被查询，绝不从一个命名约定上读取。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-17/cell/Vector/external/0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
