<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-19/cell/boundedness/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "区间上的有界性：函数的绝对值在声明的区间上保持在声明的界 ε 之内——近零平台的定义性数值性质，对区间中每个 x 有 |f(x)| ≤ ε。其定义律是一阶 logic:Formula math:boundednessLaw（rdfs:seeAlso）。它是数值性质（对函数量值的界），有别于测度支配（对积分的界）；界 ε 通过 math:hasBound 命名，其成立所在的区间通过 math:boundOnInterval 命名。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-19/cell/boundednessLaw/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-19/cell/boundednessLaw/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-19/cell/boundednessLaw/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-19/cell/boundednessLaw/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/boundednessLaw> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-19/cell/boundednessLaw/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "bornitude : |f(x)| ≤ ε pour tout x dans l'intervalle" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-19/cell/boundednessLaw/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
