<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-2/cell/CredibleRegion/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-2/cell/CredibleRegion/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/CredibleRegion> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-2/cell/CredibleRegion/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "可信区域" .
