<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-21/cell/convexityLaw/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/convexityLaw> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-21/cell/convexityLaw/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "convexité (forme au point milieu) : f((x+y)/2) ≤ (f(x)+f(y))/2" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-21/cell/convexityLaw/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
