<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Relie un math:ModelDiagnostic (ou les math:ModelComparison, math:InformationCriterion, math:CalibrationDiagnostic et math:CrossValidationResult qui spécialisent le rôle de diagnostic sur un ajustement) au math:FittedModel qu'il évalue. Domaine un objet d'évaluation de modèle, portée math:FittedModel (précisé en prose). C'est l'arête d'ancrage qui lie une évaluation à l'ajustement dont elle parle ; un math:ModelDiagnostic ne nommant aucun modèle ajusté par elle est mal formé (math:UnanchoredDiagnostic). Une seule arête partagée pour « l'ajustement dont cette évaluation traite », jamais un quasi-synonyme par type de diagnostic." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/diagnosticFor> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "诊断针对" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/diagnosticFor> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticFor/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "将一个 math:ModelDiagnostic（或在拟合之上专门化诊断角色的 math:ModelComparison、math:InformationCriterion、math:CalibrationDiagnostic 与 math:CrossValidationResult）关联到它所评估的 math:FittedModel。定义域为一个模型评估对象，值域为 math:FittedModel（在文字中说明）。它是把一次评估系于其所论及拟合的锚定边；不通过它命名任何已拟合模型的 math:ModelDiagnostic 属于不良构造（math:UnanchoredDiagnostic）。用于“此评估所论及的拟合”的一条共享边，绝非每种诊断类型各自的近义词。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/diagnosticMethod> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "méthode de diagnostic" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/diagnosticMethod> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Relie un math:ModelDiagnostic à la méthode qu'il applique — une procédure d'analyse des résidus, un test d'adéquation, une mesure d'influence, une courbe de fiabilité ou un regroupement par erreur de calibration attendue pour un math:CalibrationDiagnostic. Domaine math:ModelDiagnostic, portée l'objet méthode de diagnostic (précisé en prose). La méthode est un objet de première classe, non une étiquette opaque, de sorte que la procédure d'un diagnostic soit interrogeable aux côtés de l'ajustement qu'il évalue ; un diagnostic ne nommant aucune méthode est mal formé (math:UnanchoredDiagnostic). Tenue à part de math:usesProofMethod (la stratégie d'une preuve) et de math:estimator (la procédure d'une estimation) : c'est la méthode qu'un diagnostic applique sur un ajustement." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/diagnosticMethod> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "诊断方法" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/diagnosticMethod> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/diagnosticMethod/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "将一个 math:ModelDiagnostic 关联到它所应用的方法——一个残差分析程序、一个拟合优度检验、一个影响度量，或用于 math:CalibrationDiagnostic 的可靠性曲线或期望校准误差分箱。定义域为 math:ModelDiagnostic，值域为诊断方法对象（在文字中说明）。方法是头等对象而非不透明标签，因而一个诊断的程序可与它所评估的拟合一并被查询；不命名任何方法的诊断属于不良构造（math:UnanchoredDiagnostic）。它与 math:usesProofMethod（一个证明的策略）和 math:estimator（一个估计的程序）保持分开：这是一个诊断在拟合之上所应用的方法。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/differentiationBinder/external/0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
