<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSize/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "效应量" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSize/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSize/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSize/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSize/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/effectSize> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSize/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "将一个推断结果对象或一个 math:HypothesisTest 关联到伴随它的 math:EffectSize——结果所关切效应的标准化幅度，与其显著性并列。定义域为一个结果对象或一个 math:HypothesisTest，值域为 math:EffectSize（在文字中说明）。将效应量命名为对象，正是让“效应有多大”而不仅是“它是否显著”得以被回答——一个有 p 值却无效应量的检验，报告了可区分性却无幅度。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
