<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "contraste de taille d'effet" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/effectSizeContrast> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Relie une math:EffectSize au math:StatisticalContrast dont elle mesure la magnitude — la comparaison entre modalités (une différence, un ratio, un rapport de cotes) dont la taille d'effet quantifie l'ampleur. Domaine math:EffectSize, portée math:StatisticalContrast (précisé en prose). C'est le MÊME objet math:StatisticalContrast partagé qu'un math:Estimand cible via math:targetContrast — un seul contraste modélisé référencé à la fois par la cible de l'estimande et la magnitude de la taille d'effet, jamais deux quasi-synonymes — de sorte que la taille d'effet et l'estimande parlent de la même comparaison. Une taille d'effet ne nommant aucun contraste est ininterprétable (math:UnframedEffectSize)." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/effectSizeContrast> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "效应量对比" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/effectSizeContrast> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeContrast/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "将一个 math:EffectSize 关联到它所度量幅度的 math:StatisticalContrast——效应量所量化其大小的、各方之间的比较（一个差、一个比值、一个比值比）。定义域为 math:EffectSize，值域为 math:StatisticalContrast（在文字中说明）。这与一个 math:Estimand 通过 math:targetContrast 所指向的是同一个共享 math:StatisticalContrast 对象——一个建模的对比被估计目标之靶与效应量之幅度共同引用，绝非两个近义对比——因而效应量与估计目标谈论的是同一比较。不命名任何对比的效应量无法解释（math:UnframedEffectSize）。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeScale/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
