<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-22/cell/effectSizeScale/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
