<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/formalArgument> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "La variable d'abstraction d'une fonction en forme close — le x dans f(x) : relie une math:ClosedFormFunction à la math:VariableDeclaration qui est son argument formel. Domaine math:ClosedFormFunction, image math:VariableDeclaration (typiquement une math:FreeVariableDeclaration, puisque l'argument est libre dans le corps ; énoncé en prose). Chaque math:ClosedFormFunction en nomme exactement un ; une forme close sans argument formel ne dit pas sur quelle variable elle abstrait et est mal formée (math:UnboundClosedForm). C'est l'unique déclaration DONT la fonction est fonction, distinguée des math:functionParameter ajustés par lesquels elle est réglée." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/formalArgument> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "形式参数" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/formalArgument> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/formalArgument/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "闭形式函数的抽象变量——f(x) 中的 x：将一个 math:ClosedFormFunction 关联到作为其形式参数的 math:VariableDeclaration。定义域 math:ClosedFormFunction，值域 math:VariableDeclaration（通常是一个 math:FreeVariableDeclaration，因为该参数在主体中是自由的；以散文陈述）。每个 math:ClosedFormFunction 恰命名一个；没有形式参数的闭形式不说明它就哪个变量作抽象，是病态的（math:UnboundClosedForm）。它是该函数所“作为其函数”的那唯一声明，区别于对它加以调节的拟合 math:functionParameter。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/functionParameter> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "paramètre de fonction" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/functionParameter> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Un paramètre réglable d'une fonction en forme close — l'un des A, B, C, p, q qui fixent une courbe particulière au sein de la famille : relie une math:ClosedFormFunction à une math:VariableDeclaration qui est un paramètre ajusté. Domaine math:ClosedFormFunction, image math:VariableDeclaration (énoncé en prose). Cardinalité non contrainte (0..n) : une courbe peut n'avoir aucun paramètre ou en avoir plusieurs. Un paramètre est maintenu fixe tandis que le math:formalArgument varie, ce qui est exactement ce qui distingue l'argument DONT la fonction est fonction des paramètres PAR lesquels elle est réglée ; les deux entrent dans la math:definingExpression comme des feuilles math:VariableExpression." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/functionParameter> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "函数参数" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-24/cell/functionParameter/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
