<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-25/cell/hasIntervalBound/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
