<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-25/cell/hasMissingnessIndicator/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "将一个 math:StatisticalVariable 关联到 math:MissingnessIndicator，后者逐观测单元标记其值是存在还是缺失。定义域为 math:StatisticalVariable，值域为 math:MissingnessIndicator（在文字中说明）。承载该指示是变量之值编码了缺失的可检测标记，这要求依赖该变量的分析通过 math:missingnessMechanism 声明其 math:MissingnessMechanism（否则即 math:ImplicitMissingness）。" .
