<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/literalValue/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/literalValue/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/literalValue> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/literalValue/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个 math:NumberLiteral 叶节点所指称的数：将一个 math:NumberLiteral 表达式节点关联到它所代表的 math:Number。定义域 math:NumberLiteral，值域 math:Number（以散文陈述）。该值是一个置于数系之中的良构 math:Number，而非裸的 RDF 字面量——这正是公式的句法字面叶节点得以命名一个精确数值对象、而非携带一个不透明小数的接缝。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
