<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/lowerEndpoint> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "L'extrémité inférieure d'un math:Interval — le bout gauche de { x ∈ ℝ̄ | lower ⋚ x ⋚ upper }. Domaine math:Interval, portée un littéral numérique fini (un bout inférieur borné) ou le pôle math:NegativeInfinity (un bout non borné inférieurement) (précisé en prose). Comme math:totalMass et math:extendedRealValue, c'est une rdf:Property, non une owl:ObjectProperty ni une owl:DatatypeProperty, précisément parce que sa portée couvre à la fois un littéral de type de données (l'extrémité finie) et un individu (un pôle) : aucune des deux sortes de propriété DL n'admet les deux, de sorte que l'honnête surtype RDF porte la portée réelle étendue sans contradiction DL. Chaque math:Interval en nomme exactement une ; un intervalle sans elle est mal formé (math:UnderspecifiedInterval)." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/lowerEndpoint> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "下端点" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/lowerEndpoint> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerEndpoint/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个 math:Interval 的下端点——{ x ∈ ℝ̄ | lower ⋚ x ⋚ upper } 的左端。定义域 math:Interval，值域为一个有限数值字面量（有界下端）或极点 math:NegativeInfinity（下方无界的端）（以散文说明）。与 math:totalMass 和 math:extendedRealValue 一样，它是一个 rdf:Property，而非 owl:ObjectProperty 或 owl:DatatypeProperty，正是因为其值域同时涵盖一个数据类型字面量（有限端点）与一个个体（极点）：这两种 DL 属性类型都不能同时容纳二者，因此诚实的 RDF 上位属性承载了扩展实数值域而不产生 DL 矛盾。每个 math:Interval 恰好命名一个；没有它的区间是病态的（math:UnderspecifiedInterval）。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerInclusion/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerInclusion/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
