<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-28/cell/lowerInclusion/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
