<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-29/cell/nonAffinity/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
