<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-29/cell/nonAffinityLaw/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "非仿射性：图像在一条弦上有三个不共线的点" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-29/cell/nonAffinityLaw/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
