<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/pieceDomain> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Relie un math:FunctionPiece au math:Interval qu'il gouverne — le sous-domaine sur lequel le comportement du morceau vaut. Domaine math:FunctionPiece, portée math:Interval (précisé en prose). Chaque morceau nomme exactement un domaine de morceau ; un morceau sans lui ne dit pas où il s'applique et est mal formé. L'intervalle est un math:Interval pleinement formé (les deux extrémités et les deux inclusions), de sorte qu'une cellule semi-ouverte [0, 1) se distingue de la cellule fermée [0, 1]." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/pieceDomain> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "分段定义域" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/pieceDomain> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceDomain/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "将一个 math:FunctionPiece 关联到它所支配的 math:Interval——该分段行为成立的子域。定义域 math:FunctionPiece，值域 math:Interval（以散文说明）。每个分段命名恰好一个分段定义域；没有它的分段没有说明它在何处适用，是不良构的。该区间是一个完整成形的 math:Interval（两个端点与两个包含关系），因此半开单元 [0, 1) 与闭单元 [0, 1] 得以区分。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
