<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/pieceExpression> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "expression du morceau" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/pieceExpression> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Relie un math:FunctionPiece à la math:MathematicalExpression donnant son comportement sur son domaine de morceau — la forme close que la fonction prend sur cette cellule. Domaine math:FunctionPiece, portée math:MathematicalExpression (précisé en prose). Au plus une ; elle est optionnelle car un morceau peut porter un comportement analytique qualitatif (math:hasMonotonicity, math:hasBound) au lieu d'une expression explicite, mais un morceau ne porte jamais deux expressions contradictoires." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/pieceExpression> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "分段表达式" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/pieceExpression> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/pieceExpression/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "将一个 math:FunctionPiece 关联到给出其在分段定义域上行为的 math:MathematicalExpression——函数在该单元上所取的闭式。定义域 math:FunctionPiece，值域 math:MathematicalExpression（以散文说明）。至多一个；它是可选的，因为一个分段可以承载定性解析行为（math:hasMonotonicity、math:hasBound）而非显式表达式，但一个分段绝不承载两个相互冲突的表达式。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/population/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/population/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-31/cell/population/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
