<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-34/cell/smoothnessBoundary/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
