<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-34/cell/smoothnessBoundary/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "光滑性：一个诚实记录的二阶边界（无一阶公式）" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-34/cell/smoothnessBoundary/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
