<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/EndpointInclusion/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "端点包含性" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/EndpointInclusion/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/EndpointInclusion/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
