<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Estimation" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/Estimate> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Une estimation : une valeur produite qui estime un estimande (math:estimatesEstimand) et, le cas échéant, un paramètre de modèle (math:estimatedParameter), portant sa valeur (math:estimateValue) et l'estimateur qui l'a produite (math:estimator). Une sous-classe de math:MathematicalObject et l'objet résultat structuré de la séparation processus / résultat / affirmation — ni l'activité d'analyse ni l'affirmation tenue. Le triplet tidy de broom en R remonte les coefficients de modèle sur ces objets." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/Estimate> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "估计值" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/Estimate> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimate/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个估计值：一个产出的值，它估计一个估计目标（math:estimatesEstimand），并在相关时估计一个模型参数（math:estimatedParameter），承载其值（math:estimateValue）与产出它的估计量（math:estimator）。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类，也是过程／结果／主张分离中的结构化结果对象——既非分析活动，亦非所持的主张。R 中 broom 的 tidy 三元组将模型系数提升到这些对象之上。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/Estimator> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Estimateur" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/Estimator> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Un estimateur : la PROCÉDURE d'estimation — une règle qui est une fonction des données (moindres carrés ordinaires, maximum de vraisemblance, méthode des moments, estimateur pondéré par l'inverse de la probabilité) — tenue strictement à part de l'estimation qu'il produit et de l'estimande qu'il cible. Une sous-classe de math:MathematicalObject ; une estimation nomme l'estimateur qui l'a produite via math:estimator, de sorte qu'une valeur produite ne soit jamais un nombre nu sans la procédure qui l'a calculée. L'estimateur est l'application des données vers une valeur ; la math:Estimate est une sortie de son application, et le math:Estimand est la quantité qu'il vise — trois objets distincts, jamais confondus." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/Estimator> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "估计量" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/Estimator> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Estimator/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个估计量：估计程序——一条作为数据函数的规则（普通最小二乘、极大似然、矩法、逆概率加权估计量）——与它所产出的估计值以及它所指向的估计目标严格分开。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类；一个估计通过 math:estimator 命名产出它的估计量，因而一个产出的值绝非缺少计算它之程序的裸数。估计量是从数据到值的映射；math:Estimate 是施用它的一个输出，而 math:Estimand 是它所瞄准的量——三个不同的对象，绝不混同。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ExperimentalDesign> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Plan expérimental" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ExperimentalDesign> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Un plan expérimental : l'enregistrement de première classe de la manière dont les unités d'une étude ont été structurées et affectées — un plan complètement randomisé, en blocs, factoriel, croisé ou en parcelles divisées. Une sous-classe de math:MathematicalObject ; conjointement au math:RandomizationScheme qu'il nomme, il enregistre comment les unités ont été affectées aux modalités, de sorte que le plan soit une structure interrogeable plutôt qu'une phrase dans une section de méthodes. Nommer le plan comme objet est ce qui permet de vérifier les conditions de validité d'une analyse au regard de l'affectation qui a réellement produit les données." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ExperimentalDesign> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "实验设计" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ExperimentalDesign> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/ExperimentalDesign/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个实验设计：关于一项研究的单元如何被结构化与分配的头等记录——一个完全随机、区组、析因、交叉或裂区设计。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类；连同它所命名的 math:RandomizationScheme，它记录了单元如何被分配到各方，使设计成为可查询的结构而非方法一节中的一句话。将设计命名为对象，正是让一次分析的有效性条件得以对照真正产出数据的那次分配加以核验。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-4/cell/Exponentiation/external/0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
