<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-5/cell/FunctionPiece/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/FunctionPiece> .
