<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-6/cell/ImplicitMissingness/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "当一项分析依赖于其值编码缺失的 math:StatisticalVariable——一个通过 math:hasMissingnessIndicator 承载 math:MissingnessIndicator（或引用一个 math:MissingValueCode）的变量——却不通过 math:missingnessMechanism 声明任何 math:MissingnessMechanism，从而隐式假定某种 MCAR/MAR/MNAR 机制而不加陈述时所引发的失败。每一种缺失数据方法的有效性都取决于所成立的机制；将其留作隐含属于不良构造。主关卡：SHACL-SPARQL 要求（math:ImplicitMissingnessShape）——带有已声明缺失指示的变量须命名其 math:MissingnessMechanism。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-6/cell/IncompleteConfidenceInterval/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
