<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/MissingnessIndicator/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/MissingnessIndicator/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/MissingnessIndicator/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/MissingnessIndicator/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/MissingnessIndicator> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/MissingnessIndicator/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个缺失指示：伴随变量或标志，逐观测单元标记一个 math:StatisticalVariable 之值是存在还是缺失——缺失数据文献中的 R_i。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类，通过 math:hasMissingnessIndicator 附着于它所标记的变量。承载缺失指示的变量，其值编码了缺失，因而依赖它的分析须声明它所假定的 math:MissingnessMechanism（MCAR/MAR/MNAR），否则即属不良构造（math:ImplicitMissingness）。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/MissingnessMechanism/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/MissingnessMechanism/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/MissingnessMechanism/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
