<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelAssumption/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "模型假定" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelAssumption/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelAssumption/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelAssumption/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelAssumption/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ModelAssumption> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelAssumption/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个模型假定：一个 math:StatisticalModel 或 math:FittedModel 就数据生成过程所设定的头等条件——误差正态性、同方差、观测独立、线性、比例风险。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类，由一个模型通过 math:modelAssumption 命名，因而一个假定是可被（由诊断）核验、（由结果）引用或报告为被违反的对象，而非留于模型选择中的隐含。假定被作为对象加以陈述的模型，其有效性条件可被查询而非折入某个方法名。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ModelComparison> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Comparaison de modèles" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ModelComparison> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Une comparaison de modèles : un objet de première classe qui soupèse deux modèles ajustés ou plus l'un contre l'autre — un test du rapport de vraisemblance, une différence de critère d'information, une comparaison de scores validés par croisement, un choix de modèle par facteur de Bayes. Une sous-classe de math:MathematicalObject ; elle nomme les objets math:FittedModel qu'elle évalue via math:diagnosticFor (la même arête d'ancrage qu'un diagnostic emploie pour pointer vers un ajustement), de sorte que « quel modèle, et comment il s'est comparé » soit un objet auquel on peut répondre plutôt qu'une préférence implicite. Rendre la comparaison de première classe est ce qui maintient la sélection de modèle auditable plutôt que lue sur un seul nombre rapporté." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ModelComparison> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "模型比较" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ModelComparison> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelComparison/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个模型比较：一个头等对象，将两个或更多已拟合模型彼此权衡——一个似然比检验、一个信息准则之差、一个交叉验证分数比较、一个贝叶斯因子模型选择。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类；它通过 math:diagnosticFor 命名它所评估的 math:FittedModel 对象（与一个诊断指向拟合所用的同一条锚定边），因而“哪个模型、如何比较”是一个可回答的对象而非一种隐含偏好。使比较成为头等，正是使模型选择保持可审计而非从单个所报数值上读取。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/fr/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ModelDiagnostic> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/fr/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Diagnostic de modèle" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/fr/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingFr> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ModelDiagnostic> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "Un diagnostic de modèle : une évaluation de première classe d'un modèle ajusté — le résumé d'un graphe de résidus, une évaluation Q–Q, une mesure d'hétéroscédasticité ou d'influence, une statistique d'adéquation. Une sous-classe de math:MathematicalObject qui nomme le math:FittedModel qu'elle évalue via math:diagnosticFor et la méthode de diagnostic qu'elle applique via math:diagnosticMethod, de sorte que « ce qui a été vérifié, sur quel ajustement, par quelle méthode » soit interrogeable plutôt que replié dans la légende d'un graphe. Un diagnostic ancré ni à son modèle ajusté ni à sa méthode est mal formé (math:UnanchoredDiagnostic)." .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/zh/rdfs-label> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "rdfs:label" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ModelDiagnostic> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/zh/rdfs-label> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "模型诊断" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/zh/skos-definition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingCoverage> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingAttribute> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingZh> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingTerm> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/ModelDiagnostic> .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9/cell/ModelDiagnostic/zh/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingValue> "一个模型诊断：对一个已拟合模型的头等评估——一张残差图的摘要、一次 Q–Q 评估、一个异方差或影响度量、一个拟合优度统计量。它是 math:MathematicalObject 的子类，通过 math:diagnosticFor 命名它所评估的 math:FittedModel，通过 math:diagnosticMethod 命名它所应用的诊断方法，因而“核验了什么、在哪个拟合上、由哪种方法”可被查询而非折入某张图的题注。既不锚定其已拟合模型也不锚定其方法的诊断属于不良构造（math:UnanchoredDiagnostic）。" .
<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/math/authoring-packet/whole/batch-9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthoringPacket> .
