<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/slice-quality-rubric/authoring-packet/whole/batch-0/cell/AxisExemption/fr/skos-definition> <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/groundingPredicate> "skos:definition" .
